## Code Example

```javascript
// Simple chunker
function chunkText(text, maxChars) {
  const chunks = [];
  for (let i = 0; i < text.length; i += maxChars) {
    chunks.push(text.slice(i, i + maxChars));
  }
  return chunks;
}
```

